{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1772833728978,"sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","part":{"id":"prt_cc51fe923001mKRlTBSaUQPb5q","sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","messageID":"msg_cc51fbd3e001yGD3M9SaZaR3n6","type":"tool","callID":"call_function_ulf9nwgteykn_1","tool":"read","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/home/paule/MAD/server/templates/client.html"},"output":"<path>/home/paule/MAD/server/templates/client.html</path>\n<type>file</type>\n<content>1: <!DOCTYPE html>\n2: <html lang=\"en\">\n3: <head>\n4:     <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n5:     <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n6:     <title>Client: {{.ClientID}}</title>\n7:     <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n8:     <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/static/manifest.json\">\n9:     <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0d1117\">\n10:     <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\">\n11:     <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"black-translucent\">\n12:     <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/static/icon-192.png\">\n13:     <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@2.0.4\"></script>    <style>\n14:         * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n15:         body {\n16:             font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, monospace;\n17:             background: #0d1117;\n18:             color: #c9d1d9;\n19:             padding: 2rem;\n20:         }\n21:         h1, h2 {\n22:             color: #58a6ff;\n23:             font-weight: 600;\n24:         }\n25:         h1 { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }\n26:         h2 { font-size: 1.1rem; margin: 2rem 0 1rem 0; }\n27:         a { color: #58a6ff; text-decoration: none; }\n28:         a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }\n29:         .back-link { margin-bottom: 1.5rem; display: inline-block; font-size: 0.9rem; }\n30:         .client-status {\n31:             font-size: 0.85rem;\n32:             margin-bottom: 1rem;\n33:             color: #8b949e;\n34:         }\n35:         .status-dot {\n36:             display: inline-block;\n37:             width: 8px;\n38:             height: 8px;\n39:             border-radius: 50%;\n40:             margin-right: 0.4rem;\n41:         }\n42:         .status-active { background: #3fb950; }\n43:         .status-stale { background: #484f58; }\n44: \n45:         /* Stage sections */\n46:         .stage-section {\n47:             background: #161b22;\n48:             border-radius: 6px;\n49:             margin-bottom: 0.5rem;\n50:             overflow: hidden;\n51:         }\n52:         .stage-toggle {\n53:             width: 100%;\n54:             display: flex;\n55:             justify-content: space-between;\n56:             align-items: center;\n57:             padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem;\n58:             background: #1c2128;\n59:             border: none;\n60:             color: #8b949e;\n61:             font-family: inherit;\n62:             font-size: 0.8rem;\n63:             font-weight: 600;\n64:             text-transform: uppercase;\n65:             letter-spacing: 0.05em;\n66:             cursor: pointer;\n67:             text-align: left;\n68:         }\n69:         .stage-toggle:hover { background: #21262d; }\n70:         .stage-toggle .arrow {\n71:             transition: transform 0.15s;\n72:             font-size: 0.7rem;\n73:         }\n74:         .stage-toggle.collapsed .arrow { transform: rotate(-90deg); }\n75:         .stage-count {\n76:             background: #30363d;\n77:             color: #8b949e;\n78:             padding: 0.1rem 0.45rem;\n79:             border-radius: 10px;\n80:             font-size: 0.7rem;\n81:             min-width: 1.3rem;\n82:             text-align: center;\n83:             margin-left: 0.5rem;\n84:         }\n85:         .stage-count.has-items {\n86:             background: #1f6feb;\n87:             color: #fff;\n88:         }\n89:         .stage-body {\n90:             padding: 0.5rem 0.75rem;\n91:         }\n92:         .stage-body.hidden { display: none; }\n93: \n94:         .feature-card {\n95:             background: #0d1117;\n96:             border: 1px solid #21262d;\n97:             border-radius: 4px;\n98:             padding: 0.5rem 0.6rem;\n99:             font-size: 0.8rem;\n100:             cursor: pointer;\n101:             margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n102:             transition: border-color 0.15s;\n103:         }\n104:         .feature-card:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; }\n105:         .feature-card:hover { border-color: #58a6ff; }\n106:         .feature-card .title {\n107:             color: #c9d1d9;\n108:             font-weight: 500;\n109:             margin-bottom: 0.25rem;\n110:             word-break: break-word;\n111:         }\n112:         .feature-card .meta {\n113:             color: #484f58;\n114:             font-size: 0.7rem;\n115:         }\n116:         .feature-card .meta span { margin-right: 0.5rem; }\n117: \n118:         /* Feature detail (inline expand) */\n119:         .feature-detail {\n120:             background: #1c2128;\n121:             border: 1px solid #30363d;\n122:             border-radius: 4px;\n123:             padding: 0.75rem;\n124:             margin-bottom: 0.4rem;\n125:             font-size: 0.8rem;\n126:         }\n127:         .feature-detail .detail-row {\n128:             display: flex;\n129:             padding: 0.3rem 0;\n130:             border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;\n131:         }\n132:         .feature-detail .detail-row:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n133:         .feature-detail .detail-label {\n134:             color: #8b949e;\n135:             width: 70px;\n136:             flex-shrink: 0;\n137:             font-weight: 600;\n138:         }\n139:         .feature-detail .detail-value {\n140:             color: #c9d1d9;\n141:             word-break: break-word;\n142:         }\n143: \n144:         /* Logs */\n145:         .log-list {\n146:             background: #161b22;\n147:             border-radius: 6px;\n148:             padding: 1rem;\n149:             max-height: 500px;\n150:             overflow-y: auto;\n151:         }\n152:         .log-entry {\n153:             padding: 0.35rem 0;\n154:             border-bottom: 1px solid #21262d;\n155:             font-size: 0.85rem;\n156:             font-family: monospace;\n157:         }\n158:         .log-entry:last-child { border-bottom: none; }\n159:         .log-ts { color: #484f58; margin-right: 0.5rem; }\n160:         .log-phase { color: #d2a8ff; margin-right: 0.5rem; font-weight: 600; }\n161:         .log-output { color: #c9d1d9; }\n162:         .empty-state {\n163:             text-align: center;\n164:             padding: 2rem;\n165:             color: #484f58;\n166:         }\n167:         .empty-stage {\n168:             color: #484f58;\n169:             font-size: 0.75rem;\n170:             font-style: italic;\n171:             padding: 0.25rem 0;\n172:         }\n173:         .modal-overlay {\n174:             display: none;\n175:             position: fixed;\n176:             top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; bottom: 0;\n177:             background: rgba(0,0,0,0.6);\n178:             z-index: 100;\n179:             justify-content: center;\n180:             align-items: center;\n181:         }\n182:         .modal-overlay.active { display: flex; }\n183:         .modal {\n184:             background: #161b22;\n185:             border: 1px solid #30363d;\n186:             border-radius: 8px;\n187:             padding: 1.5rem;\n188:             max-width: 500px;\n189:             width: 90%;\n190:             max-height: 80vh;\n191:             overflow-y: auto;\n192:         }\n193:     </style>\n194: </head>\n195: <body>\n196:     <a class=\"back-link\" href=\"/?key={{.Key}}\">&larr; Back to Dashboard</a>\n197:     <h1>Client: {{.ClientID}}</h1>\n198:     <div class=\"client-status\">\n199:         {{if .Connected}}<span class=\"status-dot status-active\"></span>Connected{{else}}<span class=\"status-dot status-stale\"></span>Disconnected{{end}}\n200:         &mdash; Last seen: {{.LastSeen.Format \"2006-01-02 15:04:05\"}}\n201:     </div>\n202: \n203:     <div id=\"agent-status\" style=\"display:flex;gap:1rem;margin:1rem 0\">\n204:         <div id=\"plan-agent-card\" style=\"flex:1;background:#161b22;border-radius:6px;padding:0.75rem\">\n205:             <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.3rem\">\n206:                 <span style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase\">Plan Agent</span>\n207:                 <button id=\"auto-plan-btn\" onclick=\"toggleAutoMode('plan')\"\n208:                     style=\"padding:0.2rem 0.6rem;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.7rem;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600;{{if .AutoPlan}}background:#238636;color:#fff{{else}}background:#30363d;color:#8b949e{{end}}\">\n209:                     Auto-Plan {{if .AutoPlan}}ON{{else}}OFF{{end}}\n210:                 </button>\n211:             </div>\n212:             <span id=\"plan-agent-body\">{{if .PlanAgent.Running}}<span class=\"status-dot status-active\"></span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">{{.PlanAgent.Phase}}</span>\n213:             {{if .PlanAgent.Feature}}<span style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:0.8rem\"> &mdash; {{.PlanAgent.Feature}}</span>{{end}}\n214:             {{if .PlanAgent.Agent}}<span style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:0.75rem\"> ({{.PlanAgent.Agent}})</span>{{end}}\n215:             {{else}}<span style=\"color:#484f58\">idle</span>{{end}}</span>\n216:         </div>\n217:         <div id=\"impl-agent-card\" style=\"flex:1;background:#161b22;border-radius:6px;padding:0.75rem\">\n218:             <div style=\"display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;margin-bottom:0.3rem\">\n219:                 <span style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase\">Impl Agent</span>\n220:                 <button id=\"auto-impl-btn\" onclick=\"toggleAutoMode('impl')\"\n221:                     style=\"padding:0.2rem 0.6rem;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.7rem;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600;{{if .AutoImpl}}background:#238636;color:#fff{{else}}background:#30363d;color:#8b949e{{end}}\">\n222:                     Auto-Impl {{if .AutoImpl}}ON{{else}}OFF{{end}}\n223:                 </button>\n224:             </div>\n225:             <span id=\"impl-agent-body\">{{if .ImplAgent.Running}}<span class=\"status-dot status-active\"></span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">{{.ImplAgent.Phase}}</span>\n226:             {{if .ImplAgent.Feature}}<span style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:0.8rem\"> &mdash; {{.ImplAgent.Feature}}</span>{{end}}\n227:             {{if .ImplAgent.Agent}}<span style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:0.75rem\"> ({{.ImplAgent.Agent}})</span>{{end}}\n228:             {{else}}<span style=\"color:#484f58\">idle</span>{{end}}</span>\n229:         </div>\n230:     </div>\n231: \n232:     <div>\n233: \n234:     <h2>Features <button onclick=\"showNewIdeaModal()\" style=\"margin-left:0.5rem;padding:0.2rem 0.6rem;background:#238636;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.75rem;font-family:inherit;font-weight:600\">+ New Idea</button></h2>\n235:     <div id=\"features-container\">\n236:         {{template \"feature_stages\" .}}\n237:     </div>\n238: \n239:     <!-- New Idea Modal -->\n240:     <div class=\"modal-overlay\" id=\"new-idea-modal\" onclick=\"closeNewIdeaModal(event)\">\n241:         <div class=\"modal\" onclick=\"event.stopPropagation()\" style=\"max-width:450px\">\n242:             <h3 style=\"color:#58a6ff;font-size:1rem;margin-bottom:1rem\">Create New Idea</h3>\n243:             <div style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">\n244:                 <label style=\"display:block;color:#8b949e;font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem\">Title *</label>\n245:                 <input type=\"text\" id=\"new-idea-title\" placeholder=\"Enter idea title\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.5rem;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:4px;color:#c9d1d9;font-size:0.9rem;font-family:inherit\">\n246:             </div>\n247:             <div style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">\n248:                 <label style=\"display:block;color:#8b949e;font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem\">Board *</label>\n249:                 <input type=\"text\" id=\"new-idea-board\" placeholder=\"e.g., default\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.5rem;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:4px;color:#c9d1d9;font-size:0.9rem;font-family:inherit\">\n250:             </div>\n251:             <div style=\"margin-bottom:1rem\">\n252:                 <label style=\"display:block;color:#8b949e;font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:0.3rem\">Description</label>\n253:                 <textarea id=\"new-idea-description\" placeholder=\"Optional description\" rows=\"3\" style=\"width:100%;padding:0.5rem;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:4px;color:#c9d1d9;font-size:0.9rem;font-family:inherit;resize:vertical\"></textarea>\n254:             </div>\n255:             <div style=\"display:flex;gap:0.5rem;justify-content:flex-end\">\n256:                 <button onclick=\"closeNewIdeaModal()\" style=\"padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#30363d;color:#c9d1d9;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.85rem;font-family:inherit\">Cancel</button>\n257:                 <button onclick=\"submitNewIdea()\" id=\"submit-idea-btn\" style=\"padding:0.5rem 1rem;background:#238636;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.85rem;font-family:inherit\">Create Idea</button>\n258:             </div>\n259:             <div id=\"new-idea-feedback\" style=\"margin-top:0.75rem;font-size:0.85rem\"></div>\n260:         </div>\n261:     </div>\n262: \n263:     <h2>Logs</h2>\n264:     <div class=\"log-list\" hx-get=\"/clients/{{.ClientID}}/logs?key={{.Key}}\" hx-trigger=\"every 5s\" hx-swap=\"innerHTML\">\n265:         {{template \"log_entries\" .Logs}}\n266:     </div>\n267: \n268:     <script>\n269:         var _clientID = \"{{.ClientID}}\";\n270:         var _dashKey = \"{{.Key}}\";\n271: \n272:         // Smart polling: fetch features HTML, only update cards that actually changed.\n273:         // Preserves collapsed stages, expanded details, and form state.\n274:         var _featuresURL = '/clients/' + _clientID + '/features?key=' + encodeURIComponent(_dashKey);\n275:         var _lastFeaturesHTML = '';\n276: \n277:         function smartPollFeatures() {\n278:             fetch(_featuresURL).then(function(r) { return r.text(); }).then(function(html) {\n279:                 if (html === _lastFeaturesHTML) return; // nothing changed at all\n280:                 _lastFeaturesHTML = html;\n281: \n282:                 var container = document.getElementById('features-container');\n283:                 // Parse new HTML into a temp div\n284:                 var tmp = document.createElement('div');\n285:                 tmp.innerHTML = html;\n286: \n287:                 // Build map of current cards by feature id\n288:                 var curCards = {};\n289:                 container.querySelectorAll('.feature-card').forEach(function(c) {\n290:                     curCards[c.getAttribute('data-id')] = c;\n291:                 });\n292: \n293:                 // Walk new stage sections, update in place\n294:                 var newSections = tmp.querySelectorAll('.stage-section');\n295:                 var curSections = container.querySelectorAll('.stage-section');\n296: \n297:                 // If structure changed (stages added/removed), full replace\n298:                 if (newSections.length !== curSections.length) {\n299:                     container.innerHTML = html;\n300:                     return;\n301:                 }\n302: \n303:                 for (var si = 0; si < newSections.length; si++) {\n304:                     var curSec = curSections[si];\n305:                     var newSec = newSections[si];\n306: \n307:                     // Update count badge without touching collapsed state\n308:                     var curCount = curSec.querySelector('.stage-count');\n309:                     var newCount = newSec.querySelector('.stage-count');\n310:                     if (curCount && newCount) {\n311:                         curCount.textContent = newCount.textContent;\n312:                         curCount.className = newCount.className;\n313:                     }\n314: \n315:                     // Compare cards in this stage\n316:                     var curBody = curSec.querySelector('.stage-body');\n317:                     var newBody = newSec.querySelector('.stage-body');\n318:                     var newCards = newBody.querySelectorAll('.feature-card');\n319:                     var curStageCards = curBody.querySelectorAll('.feature-card');\n320: \n321:                     // Build a hash of each card's data attributes\n322:                     function cardHash(card) {\n323:                         return [card.getAttribute('data-id'),\n324:                                 card.getAttribute('data-stage'),\n325:                                 card.getAttribute('data-title'),\n326:                                 card.getAttribute('data-description'),\n327:                                 card.getAttribute('data-history'),\n328:                                 card.getAttribute('data-questions') || '',\n329:                                 card.getAttribute('data-available-actions') || ''].join('|');\n330:                     }\n331: \n332:                     // Quick check: same number of cards with same hashes?\n333:                     var same = curStageCards.length === newCards.length;\n334:                     if (same) {\n335:                         for (var ci = 0; ci < newCards.length; ci++) {\n336:                             if (cardHash(curStageCards[ci]) !== cardHash(newCards[ci])) {\n337:                                 same = false;\n338:                                 break;\n339:                             }\n340:                         }\n341:                     }\n342: \n343:                     if (!same) {\n344:                         // Cards changed in this stage - save expanded state, replace body content, restore\n345:                         var expanded = {};\n346:                         curBody.querySelectorAll('.feature-card').forEach(function(c) {\n347:                             var next = c.nextElementSibling;\n348:                             if (next && next.classList.contains('feature-detail')) {\n349:                                 expanded[c.getAttribute('data-id')] = next.innerHTML;\n350:                             }\n351:                         });\n352: \n353:                         // Replace only the cards inside the body, preserving the body element itself\n354:                         var wasHidden = curBody.classList.contains('hidden');\n355:                         curBody.innerHTML = newBody.innerHTML;\n356:                         if (wasHidden) curBody.classList.add('hidden');\n357: \n358:                         // Restore expanded details for cards that still exist and haven't changed\n359:                         curBody.querySelectorAll('.feature-card').forEach(function(c) {\n360:                             var fid = c.getAttribute('data-id');\n361:                             if (fid in expanded) {\n362:                                 var detail = document.createElement('div');\n363:                                 detail.className = 'feature-detail';\n364:                                 detail.innerHTML = expanded[fid];\n365:                                 c.after(detail);\n366:                             }\n367:                         });\n368:                     }\n369:                     // If same, do nothing - cards are identical, leave DOM untouched\n370:                 }\n371:             }).catch(function() {});\n372:         }\n373: \n374:         setInterval(smartPollFeatures, 5000);\n375: \n376:         // Poll agent status via JSON API\n377:         var _agentURL = '/api/clients/' + _clientID + '?key=' + encodeURIComponent(_dashKey);\n378:         function renderAgent(agent) {\n379:             if (!agent || !agent.running) return '<span style=\"color:#484f58\">idle</span>';\n380:             var h = '<span class=\"status-dot status-active\"></span><span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">' + escapeHtml(agent.phase) + '</span>';\n381:             if (agent.feature) h += '<span style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:0.8rem\"> &mdash; ' + escapeHtml(agent.feature) + '</span>';\n382:             if (agent.agent) h += '<span style=\"color:#484f58;font-size:0.75rem\"> (' + escapeHtml(agent.agent) + ')</span>';\n383:             return h;\n384:         }\n385:         function updateAutoBtn(btnId, label, enabled) {\n386:             var btn = document.getElementById(btnId);\n387:             if (!btn) return;\n388:             btn.textContent = label + (enabled ? ' ON' : ' OFF');\n389:             btn.style.background = enabled ? '#238636' : '#30363d';\n390:             btn.style.color = enabled ? '#fff' : '#8b949e';\n391:             btn.setAttribute('data-enabled', enabled ? 'true' : 'false');\n392:         }\n393:         function toggleAutoMode(mode) {\n394:             var btnId = mode === 'plan' ? 'auto-plan-btn' : 'auto-impl-btn';\n395:             var btn = document.getElementById(btnId);\n396:             var currentlyEnabled = btn.getAttribute('data-enabled') === 'true';\n397:             var newEnabled = !currentlyEnabled;\n398:             btn.disabled = true;\n399:             fetch('/api/clients/' + encodeURIComponent(_clientID) + '/auto-mode?key=' + encodeURIComponent(_dashKey), {\n400:                 method: 'POST',\n401:                 headers: {'Content-Type': 'application/json'},\n402:                 body: JSON.stringify({mode: mode, enabled: newEnabled})\n403:             }).then(function(resp) {\n404:                 if (resp.ok) {\n405:                     var label = mode === 'plan' ? 'Auto-Plan' : 'Auto-Impl';\n406:                     updateAutoBtn(btnId, label, newEnabled);\n407:                 }\n408:                 btn.disabled = false;\n409:             }).catch(function() { btn.disabled = false; });\n410:         }\n411:         // Initialize data-enabled attributes\n412:         document.getElementById('auto-plan-btn').setAttribute('data-enabled', '{{if .AutoPlan}}true{{else}}false{{end}}');\n413:         document.getElementById('auto-impl-btn').setAttribute('data-enabled', '{{if .AutoImpl}}true{{else}}false{{end}}');\n414: \n415:         function pollAgentStatus() {\n416:             fetch(_agentURL, {headers:{'Accept':'application/json'}}).then(function(r){return r.json();}).then(function(data) {\n417:                 var planHTML = renderAgent(data.plan_agent);\n418:                 var implHTML = renderAgent(data.impl_agent);\n419:                 var planEl = document.getElementById('plan-agent-body');\n420:                 var implEl = document.getElementById('impl-agent-body');\n421:                 if (planEl && planEl.innerHTML !== planHTML) planEl.innerHTML = planHTML;\n422:                 if (implEl && implEl.innerHTML !== implHTML) implEl.innerHTML = implHTML;\n423:                 // Sync auto-mode button states\n424:                 if (typeof data.auto_plan === 'boolean') updateAutoBtn('auto-plan-btn', 'Auto-Plan', data.auto_plan);\n425:                 if (typeof data.auto_impl === 'boolean') updateAutoBtn('auto-impl-btn', 'Auto-Impl', data.auto_impl);\n426:             }).catch(function(){});\n427:         }\n428:         setInterval(pollAgentStatus, 5000);\n429: \n430:         function toggleStage(btn) {\n431:             var body = btn.nextElementSibling;\n432:             btn.classList.toggle('collapsed');\n433:             body.classList.toggle('hidden');\n434:         }\n435: \n436:         function toggleFeatureDetail(card) {\n437:             var existing = card.nextElementSibling;\n438:             if (existing && existing.classList.contains('feature-detail')) {\n439:                 existing.remove();\n440:                 return;\n441:             }\n442:             var detail = document.createElement('div');\n443:             detail.className = 'feature-detail';\n444:             var html =\n445:                 '<div class=\"detail-row\"><span class=\"detail-label\">Title</span><span class=\"detail-value\">' + escapeHtml(card.getAttribute('data-title')) + '</span></div>' +\n446:                 '<div class=\"detail-row\"><span class=\"detail-label\">Stage</span><span class=\"detail-value\">' + escapeHtml(card.getAttribute('data-stage')) + '</span></div>' +\n447:                 '<div class=\"detail-row\"><span class=\"detail-label\">Board</span><span class=\"detail-value\">' + escapeHtml(card.getAttribute('data-board')) + '</span></div>' +\n448:                 '<div class=\"detail-row\"><span class=\"detail-label\">Created</span><span class=\"detail-value\">' + escapeHtml(card.getAttribute('data-created')) + '</span></div>' +\n449:                 '<div class=\"detail-row\"><span class=\"detail-label\">ID</span><span class=\"detail-value\">' + escapeHtml(card.getAttribute('data-id')) + '</span></div>';\n450:             var description = card.getAttribute('data-description') || '';\n451:             if (description) {\n452:                 html += '<div style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;padding-top:0.4rem;border-top:1px solid #21262d\">' +\n453:                     '<div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem\">Description</div>' +\n454:                     '<div style=\"color:#c9d1d9;font-size:0.8rem;white-space:pre-wrap\">' + escapeHtml(description) + '</div></div>';\n455:             }\n456:             try {\n457:                 var history = JSON.parse(card.getAttribute('data-history') || '[]');\n458:                 if (history.length > 0) {\n459:                     html += '<div style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;padding-top:0.4rem;border-top:1px solid #21262d\">' +\n460:                         '<div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.2rem\">History (' + history.length + ')</div>';\n461:                     for (var i = 0; i < history.length; i++) {\n462:                         var h = history[i];\n463:                         html += '<div style=\"font-size:0.7rem;padding:0.15rem 0;border-bottom:1px solid #161b22\">' +\n464:                             '<span style=\"color:#484f58\">' + escapeHtml(h.ts || '') + '</span> ' +\n465:                             '<span style=\"color:#d2a8ff;font-weight:600\">' + escapeHtml(h.stage || '') + '</span> ' +\n466:                             '<span style=\"color:#c9d1d9\">' + escapeHtml(h.note || '') + '</span></div>';\n467:                     }\n468:                     html += '</div>';\n469:                 }\n470:             } catch(e) {}\n471:             // Questions form for requested-input features\n472:             try {\n473:                 var questions = JSON.parse(card.getAttribute('data-questions') || '[]');\n474:                 var stage = card.getAttribute('data-stage');\n475:                 if (questions.length > 0 && stage === 'requested-input') {\n476:                     var featureID = card.getAttribute('data-id');\n477:                     html += '<div style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;padding-top:0.4rem;border-top:1px solid #21262d\">' +\n478:                         '<div style=\"color:#8b949e;font-size:0.7rem;font-weight:600;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:0.4rem\">Questions (' + questions.length + ')</div>';\n479:                     for (var qi = 0; qi < questions.length; qi++) {\n480:                         var q = questions[qi];\n481:                         html += '<div style=\"margin-bottom:0.5rem\">' +\n482:                             '<label style=\"display:block;color:#c9d1d9;font-size:0.8rem;margin-bottom:0.2rem\">' + escapeHtml(q.question) + '</label>' +\n483:                             '<input type=\"text\" class=\"qa-input\" data-qi=\"' + qi + '\" value=\"' + escapeHtml(q.answer || '') + '\" ' +\n484:                             'style=\"width:100%;padding:0.3rem 0.5rem;background:#0d1117;border:1px solid #30363d;border-radius:4px;color:#c9d1d9;font-size:0.8rem;font-family:inherit\" />' +\n485:                             '</div>';\n486:                     }\n487:                     html += '<button onclick=\"submitAnswers(this,\\'' + escapeHtml(featureID) + '\\')\" ' +\n488:                         'style=\"padding:0.35rem 0.8rem;background:#238636;color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.8rem;font-family:inherit\">Submit Answers</button>' +\n489:                         '<span class=\"answer-feedback\" style=\"margin-left:0.5rem;font-size:0.8rem\"></span>' +\n490:                         '</div>';\n491:                 }\n492:             } catch(e) {}\n493:             // Action buttons (plan / implement)\n494:             try {\n495:                 var actions = JSON.parse(card.getAttribute('data-available-actions') || '[]');\n496:                 if (actions && actions.length > 0) {\n497:                     html += '<div style=\"margin-top:0.5rem;padding-top:0.4rem;border-top:1px solid #21262d;display:flex;gap:0.5rem\">';\n498:                     for (var ai = 0; ai < actions.length; ai++) {\n499:                         var act = actions[ai];\n500:                         var label = act === 'plan' ? 'Start Planning' : 'Start Implementing';\n501:                         var btnColor = act === 'plan' ? '#1f6feb' : '#8957e5';\n502:                         var fid = card.getAttribute('data-id');\n503:                         html += '<button onclick=\"event.stopPropagation();startAgent(this,\\'' + escapeHtml(fid) + '\\',\\'' + act + '\\')\" ' +\n504:                             'style=\"padding:0.35rem 0.8rem;background:' + btnColor + ';color:#fff;border:none;border-radius:4px;cursor:pointer;font-size:0.8rem;font-family:inherit\">' +\n505:                             label + '</button>';\n506:                     }\n507:                     html += '</div>';\n508:                 }\n509:             } catch(e) {}\n510:             detail.innerHTML = html;\n511:             card.after(detail);\n512:         }\n513: \n514:         function submitAnswers(btn, featureID) {\n515:             var detail = btn.closest('.feature-detail');\n516:             var inputs = detail.querySelectorAll('.qa-input');\n517:             var questions = [];\n518:             try {\n519:                 var card = detail.previousElementSibling;\n520:                 questions = JSON.parse(card.getAttribute('data-questions') || '[]');\n521:             } catch(e) {}\n522:             var answers = [];\n523:             inputs.forEach(function(inp) {\n524:                 var idx = parseInt(inp.getAttribute('data-qi'));\n525:                 answers.push({question: questions[idx] ? questions[idx].question : '', answer: inp.value});\n526:             });\n527:             var feedback = detail.querySelector('.answer-feedback');\n528:             btn.disabled = true;\n529:             btn.textContent = 'Submitting...';\n530:             fetch('/api/clients/' + encodeURIComponent(_clientID) + '/features/' + encodeURIComponent(featureID) + '/answers?key=' + encodeURIComponent(_dashKey), {\n531:                 method: 'POST',\n532:                 headers: {'Content-Type': 'application/json'},\n533:                 body: JSON.stringify({answers: answers})\n534:             }).then(function(resp) {\n535:                 return resp.json().then(function(data) { return {ok: resp.ok, data: data}; });\n536:             }).then(function(result) {\n537:                 if (result.ok) {\n538:                     feedback.style.color = '#3fb950';\n539:                     feedback.textContent = 'Answers submitted!';\n540:                 } else {\n541:                     feedback.style.color = '#f85149';\n542:                     feedback.textContent = result.data.error || 'Failed';\n543:                 }\n544:                 btn.disabled = false;\n545:                 btn.textContent = 'Submit Answers';\n546:             }).catch(function(err) {\n547:                 feedback.style.color = '#f85149';\n548:                 feedback.textContent = 'Network error';\n549:                 btn.disabled = false;\n550:                 btn.textContent = 'Submit Answers';\n551:             });\n552:         }\n553: \n554:         function startAgent(btn, featureID, action) {\n555:             btn.disabled = true;\n556:             var origText = btn.textContent;\n557:             var origBg = btn.style.background;\n558:             btn.textContent = 'Starting...';\n559:             fetch('/api/clients/' + encodeURIComponent(_clientID) + '/features/' + encodeURIComponent(featureID) + '/start-agent?key=' + encodeURIComponent(_dashKey), {\n560:                 method: 'POST',\n561:                 headers: {'Content-Type': 'application/json'},\n562:                 body: JSON.stringify({action: action})\n563:             }).then(function(resp) {\n564:                 return resp.json().then(function(data) { return {ok: resp.ok, data: data}; });\n565:             }).then(function(result) {\n566:                 if (result.ok) {\n567:                     btn.textContent = 'Started!';\n568:                     btn.style.background = '#238636';\n569:                     setTimeout(function() { btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = origText; btn.style.background = origBg; }, 3000);\n570:                 } else {\n571:                     btn.textContent = result.data.error || 'Failed';\n572:                     btn.style.background = '#f85149';\n573:                     setTimeout(function() { btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = origText; btn.style.background = origBg; }, 3000);\n574:                 }\n575:             }).catch(function() {\n576:                 btn.textContent = 'Network error';\n577:                 btn.style.background = '#f85149';\n578:                 setTimeout(function() { btn.disabled = false; btn.textContent = origText; btn.style.background = origBg; }, 3000);\n579:             });\n580:         }\n581: \n582:         function showNewIdeaModal() {\n583:             document.getElementById('new-idea-modal').classList.add('active');\n584:             document.getElementById('new-idea-title').value = '';\n585:             document.getElementById('new-idea-board').value = '';\n586:             document.getElementById('new-idea-description').value = '';\n587:             document.getElementById('new-idea-feedback').textContent = '';\n588:             document.getElementById('new-idea-title').focus();\n589:         }\n590: \n591:         function closeNewIdeaModal(event) {\n592:             if (!event || event.target === document.getElementById('new-idea-modal')) {\n593:                 document.getElementById('new-idea-modal').classList.remove('active');\n594:             }\n595:         }\n596: \n597:         function submitNewIdea() {\n598:             var title = document.getElementById('new-idea-title').value.trim();\n599:             var board = document.getElementById('new-idea-board').value.trim();\n600:             var description = document.getElementById('new-idea-description').value.trim();\n601:             var feedback = document.getElementById('new-idea-feedback');\n602:             var btn = document.getElementById('submit-idea-btn');\n603: \n604:             if (!title) {\n605:                 feedback.style.color = '#f85149';\n606:                 feedback.textContent = 'Title is required';\n607:                 return;\n608:             }\n609:             if (!board) {\n610:                 feedback.style.color = '#f85149';\n611:                 feedback.textContent = 'Board is required';\n612:                 return;\n613:             }\n614: \n615:             btn.disabled = true;\n616:             btn.textContent = 'Creating...';\n617: \n618:             fetch('/api/clients/' + encodeURIComponent(_clientID) + '/ideas?key=' + encodeURIComponent(_dashKey), {\n619:                 method: 'POST',\n620:                 headers: {'Content-Type': 'application/json'},\n621:                 body: JSON.stringify({title: title, board: board, description: description})\n622:             }).then(function(resp) {\n623:                 return resp.json().then(function(data) { return {ok: resp.ok, data: data}; });\n624:             }).then(function(result) {\n625:                 if (result.ok) {\n626:                     feedback.style.color = '#3fb950';\n627:                     feedback.textContent = 'Idea created successfully!';\n628:                     setTimeout(function() {\n629:                         closeNewIdeaModal();\n630:                         // Trigger immediate poll to see the new idea\n631:                         smartPollFeatures();\n632:                     }, 1000);\n633:                 } else {\n634:                     feedback.style.color = '#f85149';\n635:                     feedback.textContent = result.data.error || 'Failed to create idea';\n636:                     btn.disabled = false;\n637:                     btn.textContent = 'Create Idea';\n638:                 }\n639:             }).catch(function(err) {\n640:                 feedback.style.color = '#f85149';\n641:                 feedback.textContent = 'Network error';\n642:                 btn.disabled = false;\n643:                 btn.textContent = 'Create Idea';\n644:             });\n645:         }\n646: \n647:         function escapeHtml(text) {\n648:             var div = document.createElement('div');\n649:             div.textContent = text;\n650:             return div.innerHTML;\n651:         }\n652:     </script>\n653:     <script>if ('serviceWorker' in navigator) { navigator.serviceWorker.register('/sw.js'); }</script>\n654: </body>\n655: </html>\n656: \n657: {{define \"feature_stages\"}}{{range .StageGroups}}<div class=\"stage-section\">\n658:     <button class=\"stage-toggle{{if not .Features}} collapsed{{end}}\" onclick=\"toggleStage(this)\">\n659:         <span>{{stageLabel .Stage}} <span class=\"stage-count{{if .Features}} has-items{{end}}\">{{len .Features}}</span></span>\n660:         <span class=\"arrow\">&#9660;</span>\n661:     </button>\n662:     <div class=\"stage-body{{if not .Features}} hidden{{end}}\">\n663:         {{if .Features}}{{range .Features}}<div class=\"feature-card\" onclick=\"toggleFeatureDetail(this)\"\n664:             data-title=\"{{.Title}}\"\n665:             data-stage=\"{{.Stage}}\"\n666:             data-board=\"{{.Board}}\"\n667:             data-created=\"{{.Created}}\"\n668:             data-id=\"{{.ID}}\"\n669:             data-description=\"{{.Description}}\"\n670:             data-history=\"{{toJSON .History}}\"\n671:             data-questions=\"{{toJSON .Questions}}\"\n672:             data-available-actions=\"{{toJSON .AvailableActions}}\">\n673:             <div class=\"title\">{{.Title}}</div>\n674:             <div class=\"meta\"><span>{{.Board}}</span><span>{{.Created}}</span></div>\n675:         </div>{{end}}{{else}}<div class=\"empty-stage\">No features in this stage</div>{{end}}\n676:     </div>\n677: </div>\n678: {{end}}{{end}}\n679: \n680: {{define \"log_entries\"}}{{if .}}{{range .}}<div class=\"log-entry\">\n681:     <span class=\"log-ts\">{{.Timestamp}}</span>\n682:     <span class=\"log-phase\">[{{.Phase}}]</span>\n683:     <span class=\"log-output\">{{.Output}}</span>\n684: </div>{{end}}{{else}}<div class=\"empty-state\">No log entries</div>{{end}}{{end}}\n\n(End of file - total 684 lines)\n</content>","title":"server/templates/client.html","metadata":{"preview":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Client: {{.ClientID}}</title>\n    <link rel=\"icon\" type=\"image/svg+xml\" href=\"/favicon.svg\">\n    <link rel=\"manifest\" href=\"/static/manifest.json\">\n    <meta name=\"theme-color\" content=\"#0d1117\">\n    <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-capable\" content=\"yes\">\n    <meta name=\"apple-mobile-web-app-status-bar-style\" content=\"black-translucent\">\n    <link rel=\"apple-touch-icon\" href=\"/static/icon-192.png\">\n    <script src=\"https://unpkg.com/htmx.org@2.0.4\"></script>    <style>\n        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }\n        body {\n            font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Roboto, monospace;\n            background: #0d1117;\n            color: #c9d1d9;\n            padding: 2rem;\n        }","truncated":false,"loaded":[]},"time":{"start":1772833728973,"end":1772833728977}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Let me check the client.html template to see if it has any authentication:","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":"d491a3298cc6cb10e68361223f5d986bc4ca19ea83a9afff0f806d6552f994f7"}]}}}}
{"type":"step_finish","timestamp":1772833728988,"sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","part":{"id":"prt_cc51fe9d50015hGc1h2kdNz4kg","sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","messageID":"msg_cc51fbd3e001yGD3M9SaZaR3n6","type":"step-finish","reason":"tool-calls","snapshot":"28e62dc5d76bba8eeb41e23da7e7cd17ff7416bd","cost":0.00093957,"tokens":{"total":28988,"input":38,"output":51,"reasoning":0,"cache":{"read":28899,"write":0}}}}
{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1772833734066,"sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","part":{"id":"prt_cc51ffdb100188u4MRI3QDMPA9","sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","messageID":"msg_cc51fe9ec001jurXfpti1gUTvN","type":"step-start","snapshot":"d51cc37b4670c0b22b7e0c11e60aa98c88a206fe"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1772833792729,"sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","part":{"id":"prt_cc520379d001ZqdFZ4zoe3L0MD","sessionID":"ses_33ae23cc0ffepRucRBrP1I8Zi5","messageID":"msg_cc51fe9ec001jurXfpti1gUTvN","type":"text","text":"Now I have a complete understanding of the codebase. Let me create a comprehensive plan that addresses all the issues identified in the review feedback.\n\n```json\n{\n  \"questions\": [],\n  \"plan\": \"# WebUI Key Authentication Implementation Plan\\n\\n## Overview\\nImplement a modal overlay prompting for the dashboard key, stored in localStorage. Without a valid key, the backend must not send any actual data to the frontend.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 1: Fix Critical Modal Rendering Bug\\n\\n**Issue**: The key modal (index.html lines 250-257) is INSIDE the `{{if .Authenticated}}` block (line 210). Unauthenticated users see a blank page.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n1. Restructure index.html to move key modal outside the `{{if .Authenticated}}` block\\n2. Add a separate `{{if .ShowKeyModal}}` or unconditionally render the modal container\\n3. Use JavaScript to show/hide the modal based on auth state\\n\\n**Implementation**:\\n- Move modal HTML to appear BEFORE the `{{if .Authenticated}}` conditional in index.html\\n- Keep modal in its own conditional that evaluates independently of authenticated state\\n- Backend passes `DashboardKeyConfigured` boolean to template (not just `Authenticated`)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 2: Fix Data Leakage - Server-Side Auth Enforcement\\n\\n**Issue**: api.go:139-153 fetches ALL clients/features before checking auth. Data is sent to browser but hidden with CSS.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n1. Modify the root handler (api.go:125-159) to check authentication BEFORE fetching data\\n2. If not authenticated, render minimal page with modal but NO client/feature data\\n3. Return appropriate HTTP status (401) for API calls without valid key\\n\\n**Implementation**:\\n```go\\n// In registerRoutes, for \"/\" handler (api.go:125-159)\\nkey := r.URL.Query().Get(\\\"key\\\")\\nauthenticated := key != \\\"\\\" && (cfg.DashboardKey == \\\"\\\" || key == cfg.DashboardKey)\\n\\nif !authenticated {\\n    // Only render modal, no data\\n    data := map[string]interface{}{\\n        \\\"Key\\\":           \\\"\\\",\\n        \\\"Authenticated\\\": false,\\n        \\\"ShowKeyModal\\\":  cfg.DashboardKey != \\\"\\\", // Always show modal when key is required\\n        \\\"Clients\\\":       []Client{}, // Empty data\\n        \\\"StageGroups\\\":   []StageGroup{},\\n    }\\n    // Render template (but modal will show due to ShowKeyModal)\\n    return\\n}\\n// Only fetch data if authenticated\\nclients := hub.ListClients()\\n// ... rest of data fetching\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 3: Add Client Page Authentication\\n\\n**Issue**: serveClientPage (api.go:530) does NOT validate dashboard key. Any user can access /clients/{id} without authentication.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n1. Add checkDashboardAuth call at the start of serveClientPage\\n2. Pass authentication state to client.html template\\n3. If unauthenticated, render minimal page with modal (similar to dashboard)\\n\\n**Implementation**:\\n```go\\nfunc serveClientPage(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request, hub *Hub, tmpl *template.Template, cfg *Config) {\\n    key := r.URL.Query().Get(\\\"key\\\")\\n    authenticated := key != \\\"\\\" && (cfg.DashboardKey == \\\"\\\" || key == cfg.DashboardKey)\\n    \\n    // Add authentication check\\n    if cfg.DashboardKey != \\\"\\\" && !authenticated {\\n        // Render minimal page with modal but no data\\n        data := map[string]interface{}{\\n            \\\"ClientID\\\":      \\\"\\\",\\n            \\\"Features\\\":      []FeatureSummary{},\\n            \\\"StageGroups\\\":   []StageGroup{},\\n            \\\"Logs\\\":          []LogEntry{},\\n            \\\"Key\\\":           \\\"\\\",\\n            \\\"Authenticated\\\": false,\\n            \\\"ShowKeyModal\\\":  true,\\n        }\\n        // ... render template\\n        return\\n    }\\n    // ... rest of existing logic\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 4: Add Logout/Clear Key Functionality\\n\\n**Issue**: User requested logout/clear key option in UI.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n1. Add logout button to header area (visible when authenticated)\\n2. Add clearKey() JavaScript function to remove 'mad_key' from localStorage\\n3. Reload page after clearing to return to unauthenticated state\\n\\n**Implementation**:\\n- Add to index.html header area:\\n```html\\n{{if .Authenticated}}\\n<button onclick=\\\"logout()\\\" style=\\\"...\\\">Logout</button>\\n{{end}}\\n```\\n\\n- Add JavaScript function:\\n```javascript\\nfunction logout() {\\n    if (confirm('Clear your saved key?')) {\\n        localStorage.removeItem('mad_key');\\n        // Clear URL params without reloading\\n        window.history.replaceState({}, '', window.location.pathname);\\n        location.reload();\\n    }\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 5: Add Invalid Key Error Feedback\\n\\n**Issue**: When user enters wrong key, no error message is shown. Page just reloads.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n1. Add error message display in the key modal\\n2. On saveKey(), validate key against server before saving\\n3. Show error if validation fails\\n\\n**Implementation**:\\n- Add `/api/auth/validate` endpoint:\\n```go\\nmux.HandleFunc(\\\"/api/auth/validate\\\", func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\\n    key := r.URL.Query().Get(\\\"key\\\")\\n    if cfg.DashboardKey == \\\"\\\" || key == cfg.DashboardKey {\\n        writeJSON(w, http.StatusOK, map[string]bool{\\\"valid\\\": true})\\n    } else {\\n        writeJSON(w, http.StatusUnauthorized, map[string]bool{\\\"valid\\\": false})\\n    }\\n})\\n```\\n\\n- Modify saveKey() in index.html:\\n```javascript\\nfunction saveKey() {\\n    var input = document.getElementById('key-input');\\n    var k = input.value.trim();\\n    if (!k) return;\\n    \\n    // Validate key before saving\\n    fetch('/api/auth/validate?key=' + encodeURIComponent(k))\\n        .then(function(r) { return r.json(); })\\n        .then(function(data) {\\n            if (data.valid) {\\n                localStorage.setItem('mad_key', k);\\n                document.getElementById('key-modal').classList.remove('active');\\n                location.reload();\\n            } else {\\n                document.getElementById('key-error').textContent = 'Invalid key';\\n                document.getElementById('key-error').style.display = 'block';\\n            }\\n        })\\n        .catch(function() {\\n            // Network error - allow save anyway, server will reject later\\n            localStorage.setItem('mad_key', k);\\n            location.reload();\\n        });\\n}\\n```\\n\\n- Add error display to modal HTML:\\n```html\\n<div id=\\\"key-error\\\" style=\\\"color:#f85149;font-size:0.85rem;margin-bottom:0.5rem;display:none\\\"></div>\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 6: Handle LocalStorage Unavailable\\n\\n**Issue**: Private browsing mode or disabled localStorage can cause errors.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n1. Wrap localStorage calls in try/catch\\n2. Fall back to session-only key storage or show warning\\n\\n**Implementation**:\\n```javascript\\nfunction getKey() {\\n    try {\\n        var urlKey = new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('key');\\n        if (urlKey) {\\n            localStorage.setItem('mad_key', urlKey);\\n            return urlKey;\\n        }\\n        return localStorage.getItem('mad_key') || '';\\n    } catch (e) {\\n        // localStorage unavailable\\n        return new URLSearchParams(window.location.search).get('key') || '';\\n    }\\n}\\n\\nfunction saveKey() {\\n    try {\\n        localStorage.setItem('mad_key', k);\\n    } catch (e) {\\n        alert('LocalStorage unavailable. Key will not persist after closing browser.');\\n    }\\n    // ... rest\\n}\\n\\nfunction logout() {\\n    try {\\n        localStorage.removeItem('mad_key');\\n    } catch (e) { /* ignore */ }\\n    // ...\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 7: WebSocket Dashboard Key Support\\n\\n**Issue**: WebSocket handler (api.go:279-294) only validates APIKey, not DashboardKey.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n- Currently, WebSocket is used for real-time client connections (not dashboard data). Dashboard key is for web UI access, not real-time connections. If dashboard key is required for WebSocket, add validation:\\n\\n```go\\nmux.HandleFunc(\\\"/ws\\\", func(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\\n    authorized := false\\n    // Check APIKey (existing logic)\\n    if cfg.APIKey == \\\"\\\" {\\n        authorized = true\\n    } else {\\n        if r.URL.Query().Get(\\\"api_key\\\") == cfg.APIKey {\\n            authorized = true\\n        } else if checkAPIAuth(r, cfg.APIKey) {\\n            authorized = true\\n        }\\n    }\\n    // If dashboard key is required for WebSocket access, add check\\n    if !authorized && cfg.DashboardKey != \\\"\\\" {\\n        if checkDashboardAuth(r, cfg.DashboardKey) {\\n            authorized = true\\n        }\\n    }\\n    // ... rest of handler\\n})\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Phase 8: HTMX Endpoint Protection\\n\\n**Issue**: /api/clients (api.go:201) uses checkAPIAuth, not checkDashboardAuth. Data could leak via HTMX requests.\\n\\n**Solution**:\\n- The HTMX endpoints should respect dashboard key when DashboardKey is configured\\n- Modify apiClientsHandler to also check dashboard auth:\\n\\n```go\\nfunc apiClientsHandler(w http.ResponseWriter, r *http.Request) {\\n    // Check both APIKey and DashboardKey\\n    if !checkAPIAuth(r, cfg.APIKey) && !checkDashboardAuth(r, cfg.DashboardKey) {\\n        writeJSON(w, http.StatusUnauthorized, map[string]string{\\\"error\\\": \\\"unauthorized\\\"})\\n        return\\n    }\\n    // ... rest of handler\\n}\\n```\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Implementation Order\\n\\n1. Phase 1 - Fix modal rendering (critical bug)\\n2. Phase 2 - Fix data leakage (security critical)\\n3. Phase 3 - Client page auth (security gap)\\n4. Phase 4 - Logout button (user request)\\n5. Phase 5 - Error feedback (UX improvement)\\n6. Phase 6 - LocalStorage fallback (edge case)\\n7. Phase 7 - WebSocket (if needed)\\n8. Phase 8 - HTMX endpoints (security)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Files to Modify\\n\\n1. `server/api.go` - Auth checks, data leakage fix, client page auth\\n2. `server/templates/index.html` - Modal placement, logout button, error display, JS functions\\n3. `server/templates/client.html` - Add key modal and auth check (or reuse from shared template)\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Test Scenarios\\n\\n1. DashboardKey configured, no key in URL/localStorage → Modal appears, no data in page source\\n2. DashboardKey configured, valid key entered → Modal hidden, dashboard shows data\\n3. DashboardKey configured, invalid key entered → Error message shown\\n4. DashboardKey configured, logout clicked → Key cleared, modal appears\\n5. DashboardKey NOT configured → Modal never appears, no auth required\\n6. Client page without key → Modal appears, no data shown\\n7. localStorage unavailable → Works without persistence\\n8. Network error during validation → Allows save, lets server validate on next request\"\n}\n```","time":{"start":1772833792714,"end":1772833792714}}}
